      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Read the passage and choose the correct option that best fits each of the blanks.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Communication is faster and easier for everyone. People do not need to wait long for messages because they are sent <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-901841-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-901841-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901841-0'></option><option value=\"late\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901841-0-late'>late</option><option value=\"instantly\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901841-0-instantly'>instantly</option><option value=\"leisurely\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901841-0-leisurely'>leisurely</option><option value=\"slowly\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901841-0-slowly'>slowly</option></select></span></strong>. New technology helps people share their ideas in different ways. People can use <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-901841-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-901841-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901841-1'></option><option value=\"thoughts\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901841-1-thoughts'>thoughts</option><option value=\"emojis\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901841-1-emojis'>emojis</option><option value=\"recipes\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901841-1-recipes'>recipes</option><option value=\"ideas\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901841-1-ideas'>ideas</option></select></span></strong> to show their emotions more clearly in messages. Instead of typing long texts, they send a(n) <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-901841-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-901841-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901841-2'></option><option value=\"voice message\"